direction: right
title: Automated TLS Certificate Management in Kubernetes

PatternA: Pattern A: cert-manager (Let's Encrypt) {
  style.fill: "#0B132B"
  style.stroke: "#0284C7"
  ingress: Ingress Resource (Annotation)
  ctrl: cert-manager Controller
  acme: Let's Encrypt Server
  secret: K8s Secret (tls.crt & tls.key)
  ingress -> ctrl -> acme
  ctrl -> secret
}

PatternB: Pattern B: Azure Key Vault CSI {
  style.fill: "#06201B"
  style.stroke: "#10B981"
  akv: Azure Key Vault (Corporate Cert)
  csi: Secrets Store CSI Driver
  mount: Mounted in-memory volume (tmpfs)
  pod: Spring Boot SSL KeyStore
  akv -> csi -> mount -> pod
}
